# The repository the hub's own releases live on — the source repository
# itself, not a separate releases repo: the update check is anonymous (no
# token), so the repo must be public for an installed hub to see new
# releases, and the source repo being public for 0.1.0 removes the only
# reason the two were split. Read by build/scripts/release.sh (publishing)
# and by hub/build.rs, which bakes it into the binary as
# TFSAPP_RELEASES_REPO for release.rs's hub self-update check — one file,
# not two copies of the same value.
ArnaudDelgerie/TFSAppHub
